[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 87 A car crash Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.71,
    "end": 10.152,
    "zh": "第87课 一场车祸 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第87課 一場車禍 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Can the mechanics repair Mr. Wood's car?",
    "start": 11.336,
    "end": 15.337,
    "zh": "机械师能修好伍德先生的汽车吗？",
    "zh_hant": "機械師能修好伍德先生的汽車嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Is my car ready yet?",
    "start": 17.339,
    "end": 19.54,
    "zh": "我的汽车准备好了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我的汽車準備好了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "I don't know, sir.",
    "start": 20.24,
    "end": 21.961,
    "zh": "我不知道，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "我不知道，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What's the number of your car?",
    "start": 22.201,
    "end": 24.882,
    "zh": "你的汽车牌照号是多少？",
    "zh_hant": "你的汽車牌照號是多少？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "It's LFZ",
    "start": 25.563,
    "end": 27.744,
    "zh": "是LFZ",
    "zh_hant": "是LFZ"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "312 G.",
    "start": 30.283,
    "end": 31.085,
    "zh": "312 G。",
    "zh_hant": "312 G。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "When did you bring it to us?",
    "start": 32.186,
    "end": 34.667,
    "zh": "你什么时候把它送来的？",
    "zh_hant": "你什麼時候把它送來的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I brought it here three days ago.",
    "start": 35.588,
    "end": 38.549,
    "zh": "我三天前把它送到这里来的。",
    "zh_hant": "我三天前把它送到這裡來的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Ah yes, I remember now.",
    "start": 39.109,
    "end": 42.191,
    "zh": "啊，是的，我现在记起来了。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的，我現在記起來了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Have your mechanics finished yet?",
    "start": 42.892,
    "end": 45.833,
    "zh": "你们的机械师修完了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你們的機械師修完了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "No, they're still working on it.",
    "start": 46.273,
    "end": 49.195,
    "zh": "没有，他们还在修理。",
    "zh_hant": "沒有，他們還在修理。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Let's go into the garage",
    "start": 49.535,
    "end": 52.176,
    "zh": "我们到修车厂去",
    "zh_hant": "我們到修車廠去"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "and have a look at it.",
    "start": 51.956,
    "end": 54.117,
    "zh": "看一看吧。",
    "zh_hant": "看一看吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Isn't that your car?",
    "start": 55.718,
    "end": 57.879,
    "zh": "那不是你的汽车吗？",
    "zh_hant": "那不是你的汽車嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Well, it was my car.",
    "start": 58.759,
    "end": 62.081,
    "zh": "嗯，它曾经是我的汽车。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，它曾經是我的汽車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Didn't you have a crash?",
    "start": 62.421,
    "end": 64.842,
    "zh": "你没有出事故吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你沒有出事故嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 65.243,
    "end": 66.603,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I drove it into a lamp-post.",
    "start": 67.084,
    "end": 70.005,
    "zh": "我把它撞到电线杆上了。",
    "zh_hant": "我把它撞到電線杆上了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Can your mechanics repair it?",
    "start": 70.345,
    "end": 73.026,
    "zh": "你们的机械师能修好吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你們的機械師能修好嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Well, they're trying to repair it, sir.",
    "start": 73.507,
    "end": 76.768,
    "zh": "嗯，他们正在尽力修，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，他們正在盡力修，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "But to tell you the truth, you need a new",
    "start": 76.948,
    "end": 80.962,
    "zh": "但老实告诉你，你需要一辆新的",
    "zh_hant": "但老實告訴你，你需要一輛新的"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "car!",
    "start": 80.664,
    "end": 81.608,
    "zh": "汽车！",
    "zh_hant": "汽車！"
  }
]
